  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Brand introduction:</strong> UrbanPelle is a premium leather goods brand, specializing in high-quality leather jackets, bags, handmade wallets, and belts for both men and women. Combining timeless craftsmanship with modern design, UrbanPelle offers most comfortable products that are stylish, durable, and a celebration of tradition.&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; Product description:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Leather Jackets: Premium, stylish, and exceptionally comfortable, made to last.</li>\r\n<li>Leather Bags: Elegantly designed for both functionality and fashion.</li>\r\n<li>Handmade Wallets: Minimalist designs with superior craftsmanship in various colors.</li>\r\n<li>Belts: Durable and versatile, perfect for every occasion.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): </strong>At UrbanPelle, we offer <strong>comfort with style</strong>, something not commonly found in most leather products. Our leather goods are designed to be both comfortable and stylish, providing a perfect blend of luxury and wearability.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>&bull; Payment terms:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Commission Rate: 15%-20% of each sale.</p>\r\n<p>Payment Frequency: Monthly payouts via PayPal, Bank Transfer.</p>\r\n<p>Minimum Payout Threshold: $50 minimum balance to withdraw earnings</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>&bull; Other information:</strong></p>\r\n<p>Cookie Duration: 30 days.</p>\r\n<p>Marketing Resources: Affiliates will have access to exclusive banners, product images, and pre-written content to aid promotion.</p>\r\n<p>Eligibility: Open to influencers, bloggers, and content creators with a passion for style, fashion, and leather craftsmanship.</p>\r\n<p>Support: Dedicated affiliate support to assist with any questions or promotional strategies.</p>",
